.TH AVR\-ARTIFACT\-LIST 1 "" "avr 0.5.0" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-artifact-list \- List artifacts in REPO, optionally restricted to one run.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr artifact list
[OPTIONS] REPO
.SH DESCRIPTION
List artifacts in REPO, optionally restricted to one run.
.PP
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
\fIREPO\fR
\&
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-org\fR \fITEXT\fR
Organization ID or slug.
.TP
\fB\-\-run\-id\fR \fITEXT\fR
Numeric GitHub run ID, run- ID, or native awr- ID.
.TP
\fB\-\-limit\fR \fIINTEGER RANGE\fR
Maximum artifacts per page. (default: 50)
.TP
\fB\-\-cursor\fR \fITEXT\fR
Continue from a previous page's cursor.
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR \fITEXT\fR
Output JSON. Pass comma-separated field names, "*" for all fields, or "?" to list available fields.
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-jq\fR \fITEXT\fR
Filter --json output through a jq expression.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR avr (1),
.BR avr-artifact (1),
.BR avr-artifact-delete (1),
.BR avr-artifact-download (1),
.BR avr-artifact-get (1)
